su name headquarters layout policy be map def
  su name room width ob num 320 ya
  su name room minimum height ob num 240 ya
  su name room gap ob num 20 ya
  su name room margin ob num 16 ya
  su name placement size ob num 48 ya
  su name placement gap ob num 16 ya
  su name placement row count ob num 4 ya
  su name dynamic room columns ob num 3 ya
  su name fixed room mailroom ob text "{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":320,\"height\":240}" ya
  su name fixed room chief-of-staff ob text "{\"x\":340,\"y\":0,\"width\":320,\"height\":240}" ya
  su name status activity planning ob text "active" ya
  su name status activity implementing ob text "active" ya
  su name status activity reviewing ob text "active" ya
  su name status activity revision ob text "active" ya
  su name status activity ready ob text "waiting-input" ya
  su name status activity blocked ob text "blocked" ya
  su name status activity usage-limited ob text "usage-limited" ya
  su name status activity accepted ob text "completion" ya
  su name status activity failed ob text "failure" ya
  su name channel lifecycle input ob text "waiting-input" ya
  su name channel lifecycle runtime ob text "claimed" ya
  su name channel lifecycle produce-waiting ob text "handoff" ya
  su name channel lifecycle produce-success ob text "completion" ya
  su name channel lifecycle produce-fail ob text "failure" ya
  su name handoff event assigned ob text "truth" ya
  su name handoff event accepted ob text "truth" ya
prah
su name headquarters layout policy be export ya
